<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`STATUS_SANDBOX: number = 32`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer STATUS_SANDBOX = 32;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant STATUS_SANDBOX has the value 0x20</p>
  <p>This status flag keeps the object from getting away.</p>
  <p>It causes the object to be unable to leave the sim or move more than 10 meters from the location where the flag was set.</p>
  <p>If the object tries to leave the sim or move more than 10 meters it ceases to be <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/STATUS_PHYSICS" target="_blank">physical</a> and throws a "Hit Sandbox Limit" <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Error" target="_blank">error</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
